## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to reason about end-to-end concurrency, ordering guarantees, and dynamic scaling under real-time pressure in consumer-facing systems.

## Key Concepts

- Per-source FIFO across multiple stages
- Bounded queue with backpressure policies
- Dynamic worker resizing and safe rebalancing
- Correctness under concurrent producers/consumers

## Code Example

